..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : EDISAVINGS.PREFIX
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Functionality  : Define prefix for search word of savings prices
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. The info system EDISAVINGS creates prices for blanket orders + products
..  
.. Search words for these prices used to look like this: 
.. 	VK_123456_1234_200_ABC		(VK is short for Verkauf = Sales)
.. 
.. Search words are not translated when switching the Operating language.
.. To have a neutral prefix we changed it to "S" for Savings.
.. 		
.type text savingsprefix ? _F|defined(U|savingsprefix)
.formula U|savingsprefix = "S"
.. 
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
